     A* ==========================================================
     A* RAMA BANK - Account Master Logical (keyed by Customer ID)
     A* Lets programs CHAIN/SETLL accounts by customer instead of
     A* only by ACCTNUM. SQL queries can also use this access path.
     A* ==========================================================
     A          R ACCTMREC                  PFILE(ACCTMST)
     A            ACCTNUM
     A            CUSTID
     A          K CUSTID
     A          K ACCTNUM
     A* ==========================================================
     A* RAMA BANK - Transaction History Logical (keyed by Account)
     A* Used by statement/ministatement programs for efficient
     A* retrieval in date/time descending order.
     A* ==========================================================
     A          R TXNHREC                   PFILE(TXNHIST)
     A          K ACCTNUM
     A          K TXNDATE
     A          K TXNTIME
